---
import { site } from '../config/site'
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---
<BaseLayout routeKey="privacy"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 mt-24 sm:mt-32 lg:mt-40"><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:max-w-none"><div data-reveal-item="" data-reveal-variant="slide" class="reveal-item"><h1><span class="block font-display text-base font-semibold text-neutral-950">privacy</span><span class="sr-only"> - </span><span class="mt-6 block max-w-5xl font-display text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-neutral-950 [text-wrap:balance] sm:text-6xl">Privacy at Embeddings</span></h1><div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-xl text-neutral-600"><p>This notice covers the Embeddings marketing site at embeddings.au and business enquiries submitted through the contact form or by email.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 mt-16 sm:mt-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:max-w-none"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-12 text-base leading-7 text-neutral-600"><p><strong class="font-semibold text-neutral-950">Last updated:</strong> <!-- -->30 August 2026</p><section><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-950">What this notice covers</h2><div class="mt-5 space-y-4"><p>embeddings.au is Embeddings’ public marketing site. This notice explains the personal information handled when you visit the site, submit a business enquiry, or contact Embeddings by email. Other sites linked from Embeddings are outside the scope of this notice.</p></div></section><section><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-950">Information handled by this site</h2><div class="mt-5 space-y-4"><p>When you visit this site, service providers may handle technical and usage information such as your IP address, browser, device, referring page, pages visited, and interactions with the site. Browser storage may be used to support analytics and recognise a returning browser.</p><p>If you submit a business enquiry, Embeddings receives the contact details, company information, budget range, and message that you choose to provide.</p></div></section><section><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-950">How information is used</h2><div class="mt-5 space-y-4"><p>Embeddings uses information to operate and protect the site, understand how it is used, answer business enquiries, assess potential business relationships, maintain business records, meet legal duties, and resolve disputes.</p></div></section><section><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-950">Sharing and retention</h2><div class="mt-5 space-y-4"><p>Embeddings does not sell personal information. Information may be handled by providers that support website hosting, enquiry delivery, analytics, security, or professional advice. Embeddings may also disclose information when required by law.</p><p>Information is kept only for as long as it is reasonably needed for these purposes. Service providers may process information outside Australia under their own terms and safeguards.</p></div></section><section><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-950">Your choices and contact</h2><div class="mt-5 space-y-4"><p>You can contact Embeddings by email instead of using the enquiry form. You can also block or clear browser storage through your browser. To ask about, correct, or request deletion of personal information you sent to Embeddings, email<!-- --> <a class="font-semibold text-neutral-950 underline decoration-neutral-300 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-neutral-950" href={`mailto:${site.publicEmail}`}>{site.publicEmail}</a>. Embeddings will respond subject to applicable legal obligations.</p></div></section><section><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-950">Changes to this notice</h2><div class="mt-5 space-y-4"><p>Embeddings may update this notice when the site, service providers, or legal obligations change. The date at the top shows the latest published version.</p></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></BaseLayout>
